{"kind":"coverage","sut":"LogisticsWindowUI create-route toast wiring","sut_file":"Source/Parsek/UI/LogisticsWindowUI.cs","sut_line":2968,"case_kind":"integration","proposed_name":"CreateRouteFromCandidate_WiresManualLoopClearedToast","sketch":"Both Toast_* cells re-issue the ShouldToastManualLoopCleared / FormatManualLoopTurnedOffToast pair inline because the IMGUI create path is not xUnit-drivable, so nothing pins that LogisticsWindowUI actually calls them. Add a bounded source-text wiring gate over the CreateRouteFromCandidate body (same pattern as RouteGoBackRewindReconcileTests.HandleRewindOnLoad_RunsRetireThenReconcileBeforeCareerRestore): assert ShouldToastManualLoopCleared( appears and FormatManualLoopTurnedOffToast( appears after it, anchored between the method entry/exit markers.","guards":"Deleting LogisticsWindowUI.cs:2968-2971 (the only production call site of either helper) leaves the whole suite green today, so the manual-loop-cleared toast can be silently removed.","risk":"ui"}
